    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Quadratic kernel - special case of 2nd order polynomial kernel</para>
<para>Defined for two vectors <bold>x</bold> and <bold>y</bold>:</para>
<para><formula id="39">\[ K(\mathbf{x}, \mathbf{y}) = \Big( \mathbf{x}^T \mathbf{y} \Big)^2 = \Big( \sum_i x^{(i)} y^{(i)} \Big)^2 \]</formula></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classKern__Base" kindref="compound">Kern_Base</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
